                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "These are not valid redfish message ids per bmcweb and they also do not correlate to the \"new style\" events.  We cannot just put arbitrary strings in without adding them to some Redfish registry."
                },
                {
                    "file": "include/threshold_alarm_event_monitor.hpp",
                    "line": 174,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Sean He",
                        "email": "sean.he.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Dsean0212"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi Patrick,\nThank you for bringing this mistake to my attention. I have replaced the invalid message IDs with those used for Critical Alarming, as there are no entries related to Sensor HardShutdown or Non-Recoverable events in the Redfish registry."
                }
            ],
